"alt":"A range add on a six-value lazy tree. The update walks down from the root: nodes outside the range return at once, nodes partly inside recurse into both children, and each node lying fully inside the range receives a tag and a corrected sum without any visit to its leaves. Sums of the partly covered nodes are recomputed on the way back up. The presets add to a middle range, to a range under a node that already holds a tag, and to a block-aligned range.",
"legendLabels":{"current":"Covered, tag placed","compare":"Partly inside","invalid":"Outside the range","done":"Sum recomputed","path":"Received pushed tag"},
